<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aniket Tamang | Demon Slayer Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <div class="aura-glow" id="aura"></div>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">ANIKET<span>.</span></div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#hero">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About & Hobbies</a></li>
            <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects">Missions</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <header id="hero" class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h5 class="subtitle">MEMBER OF THE DEVELOPER CORPS</h5>
            <h1 class="breathing-text">ANIKET TAMANG</h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">Mastering the arts of code, creation, and digital breathing styles. Turning complex logic into breathtaking visuals.</p>
            <div class="btn-group">
                <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Missions</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Get In Touch</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="about" class="section about-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">The Breath of Creativity</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Who I am beyond the code</p>
            
            <div class="about-grid">
                <div class="about-text">
                    <h3>Hello, I'm Aniket.</h3>
                    <p>Just like a swordsman refining his form, I dedicate myself to mastering digital creation. I don't just write code; I construct experiences. Whether I'm building responsive web architectures or experimenting with cutting-edge tech, I bring maximum focus and intensity to everything I do.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="hobbies-container">
                    <h3>Interests & Hobbies</h3>
                    <div class="hobby-tags">
                        <span class="tag">🎸 Playing Guitar</span>
                        <span class="tag">🎤 Singing</span>
                        <span class="tag">📚 Reading Books</span>
                        <span class="tag">🎬 Watching Movies</span>
                        <span class="tag">🤖 AI Tools & Prompting</span>
                        <span class="tag">✨ Creative Arts</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="skills" class="section skills-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Developer Slayer Skills</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">My technical arsenal and breathing techniques</p>
            
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">⚡</div>
                    <h3>Frontend Mastery</h3>
                    <p>HTML5, CSS3, Modern JavaScript, UI/UX Responsive Design, Framework Integration.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">🔥</div>
                    <h3>Backend Techniques</h3>
                    <p>Node.js, Express, RESTful APIs, Database management, and Server optimization.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">🌊</div>
                    <h3>Creative & AI Tools</h3>
                    <p>Advanced Prompt Engineering, Workflow Automation, Graphics Generation, UI Styling.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">⚔️</div>
                    <h3>Version Control</h3>
                    <p>Git, GitHub, deployment pipelines, clean code writing, and agile development architecture.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects" class="section projects-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Completed Missions</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">A showcase of battle-tested applications</p>
            
            <div class="projects-grid">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-banner project-1"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3>Project: Total Concentration</h3>
                        <p>A high-performance web application optimizing user workflows using strict Javascript and dynamic state management.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-banner project-2"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3>Project: Hinokami Interface</h3>
                        <p>An immersive e-commerce portal utilizing striking animations, custom UI components, and lightning-fast loading speeds.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-banner project-3"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3>Project: The AI Nichirin</h3>
                        <p>A web tool integrated with automated pipelines to assist creators in content formatting, prompt generation, and visual layout rendering.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="section contact-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Send a Crow</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Let's forge something legendary together</p>
            
            <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <input type="email" id="email" value="bunnytamang635@gmail.com" readonly required>
                    <small>Direct Line</small>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <textarea id="message" placeholder="State your mission objective..." required></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Cast Breathing Form</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Aniket Tamang. All Rights Reserved. Crafted with Total Concentration. 🔥⚔️</p>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
